    private String name;

    public Animal(String name) {
        this.name = name;
    }

    @Override
    public String toString() {
        return "Animal{" +
                "name='" + name + '\'' +
                '"}';
    }
}
```

2. **Modifying a method signature**: Modify a method signature to improve readability and maintainability.
```java
