    System.out.println("Hello, " + name);
}
```

3. **Creating a new class**: Create a new class to implement a specific functionality.
```java
public class MyClass {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        MyClass obj = new MyClass(); // create a new class
        obj.greet();  // create a new method
    }
}
```

4. **Updating a property**: Update a property to improve organization and maintainability.
```java
public void setName(String name) {
    this.name = name;
}
```

5. **Deleting an object**: Delete an object from memory.
```java
