    int oldParamNumber = paramNumber;
    paramNumber = 10;
    System.out.println(paramNumber);  // prints 10
}
```

8. **Removing an object**: Remove an object from memory.
```java
Object obj = new Object();
obj.removeFromMemory();
```

9. **Updating an object’s properties**: Update an object’s properties to improve organization and maintainability.
